# Deploy the marketing site only.
#
# vercel.json sets outputDirectory to site/. That is deliberate rather than
# incidental: Vercel serves a root-level public/ directory by convention, and
# this repo has one containing the operator console — a screen with an Approve
# button wired to a live bank. This file is the second guard so a change to
# vercel.json can never quietly publish it.
#
# Excludes are listed explicitly rather than as "* then re-include site/",
# because an ignore file cannot re-include a path whose parent is excluded —
# that idiom silently shipped nothing but vercel.json.

src/
public/
dashboard/
scripts/
data/
build/
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
package.json
package-lock.json
README.md
FINDINGS.md
